Most modern languages are designed for laziness, and I think AI is the ultimate destination. Basically, you have the knowledge but are too lazy to type it out and don't want to waste brainpower on manual coding, so you just tell AI to type it for you. The rest of the job is putting 100% of your brainpower into messing around with the game and having AI write the code. Whatever AI can do faster and isn't worth the brainpower, just offload it completely to AI.
